{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222920/extras/e58aa6088e3fbf9b258079af4a43ef9e.avif?t=1757539921\" width=600 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of an <strong>interior designer</strong> in a world in desperate need of creative touch. Bring your own and your clients' visions to life in this isometric and colorful simulation game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR REPUTATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from humble beginnings in <i>Central Point</i>, and work your way up to designing grand mansions in the\u00a0<i>Woodlands</i>. The better you perform, the more opportunities will come your way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OVER 500 ITEMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost every job offers something new to decorate with. Don't forget to explore the cities for hidden items and special decor pieces! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ICONIC ISOMETRIC ARTSTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a 3D world in an isometric point of view, capturing the charm of classic games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RELAXING, YET REWARDING GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interior Tales offers a stress-free and forgiving gameplay experience while maintaining core simulation elements like an economy and progressive career development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222920/extras/879dcc7439b6de4e8f9025bb6d43579d.poster.avif?t=1757539921\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222920/extras/879dcc7439b6de4e8f9025bb6d43579d.webm?t=1757539921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222920/extras/879dcc7439b6de4e8f9025bb6d43579d.mp4?t=1757539921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3222920?t=1757539921","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3222920?t=1757539921","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222920/697e873f8b98828e10f53b89c52f387d409af867/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757539921","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222920/697e873f8b98828e10f53b89c52f387d409af867/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757539921","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222920/extras/e58aa6088e3fbf9b258079af4a43ef9e.avif?t=1757539921\" width=600 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of an <strong>interior designer</strong> in a world in desperate need of creative touch. Bring your own and your clients' visions to life in this isometric and colorful simulation game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR REPUTATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from humble beginnings in <i>Central Point</i>, and work your way up to designing grand mansions in the\u00a0<i>Woodlands</i>. The better you perform, the more opportunities will come your way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OVER 500 ITEMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost every job offers something new to decorate with. Don't forget to explore the cities for hidden items and special decor pieces! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ICONIC ISOMETRIC ARTSTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a 3D world in an isometric point of view, capturing the charm of classic games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RELAXING, YET REWARDING GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interior Tales offers a stress-free and forgiving gameplay experience while maintaining core simulation elements like an economy and progressive career development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222920/extras/879dcc7439b6de4e8f9025bb6d43579d.poster.avif?t=1757539921\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222920/extras/879dcc7439b6de4e8f9025bb6d43579d.webm?t=1757539921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222920/extras/879dcc7439b6de4e8f9025bb6d43579d.mp4?t=1757539921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Gearious Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222920/header.jpg?t=1757539921","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6400 (Skylake)<br></li><li><